    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c845fbb7def22cff93dd785"
      },
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Is it safe to spend most of our days in a DropShip hundreds of years old like the <i>Hysteria</i>, with only a thin shell separating us from death from freezing and suffocation from the space vacuum?\n\nLikely not, but I am just just stating what it is, I wasn't the one who decided to come a backward world looking for a non-existent contract in the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreMercenaryReviewBoard],MRB]] database.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
