    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c78d2fe9981891fa9563127"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "We should at least file a complain with the MRB to be compensated with the travel JumpShip fees and other expenses we incurred from their database error.\n\nI don't think I ever heard this happening before: an ancient contract being reactivated and assigned to us.",
