    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c92c10078efdb8bc80d3f75"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "You want to file a complaint against [[DM.Factions[faction_ComStar],ComStar]] and the MRB??? They're the ones running nearly the entire mercenary business, they'll never acknowledge the error was theirs.\n\nForget it, let us get out of this world, it already looks like one of the worlds of the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreReapersScore],Reaper's Score]].",
