        "id": "9c17ff7bbf8c90b8f71c7e82"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "They will still need to fix the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreJumpShip],JumpShip]]'s helium leaks, Yang, if those fail during a hyperjump we could suffer a catastrophic event and either be completely disintegrated upon arrival, or worse, discover that we are completely off course in uncharted space.\n\nBut I think I might have the solution since another JumpShip was reported to have arrived days ago.",
