      "text": "If he means Colonel MacLeod of the Northwind Highlanders, I personally watched his body being recovered from the cockpit of his <i>Highlander</i>.\n\nAnd Darius later shipped him back to [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreNorthwindClan],Clan MacLeod]] for a proper military burial after they paid the bill for storage and transport.",
